    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RESOURCE COLLECTION AND CRAFT</h2>On your journey, you will encounter various resources from which you can create weapons, armor, various items, or exchange them with a merchant.<br>Be careful, the space in your backpack is not endless, you will have to choose what to take with you and what to leave.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EVERY ADVENTURE WILL BE UNIQUE</h2>The Roguelike system will make each race unique, a procedurally generated map, dungeons, train stations, loot will not let you get bored!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591880/extras/3fc7e9a0de10f977b19c519737d163be.poster.avif?t=1709741629\" width=620 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591880/extras/3fc7e9a0de10f977b19c519737d163be.webm?t=1709741629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591880/extras/3fc7e9a0de10f977b19c519737d163be.mp4?t=1709741629\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BATTLE SYSTEM</h2>The weapons have unique mechanics - homing missiles, an energy ball, ballistic projectiles, and maybe ninja frogs...? Moreover, each projectile has its own type of damage - Normal, Energy, Frost, Fire, Poison. Weapons with different damage types pair well or poorly with active artifacts!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591880/extras/151d8a94a050fa7923b99b57cd00ef74.poster.avif?t=1709741629\" width=620 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591880/extras/151d8a94a050fa7923b99b57cd00ef74.webm?t=1709741629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591880/extras/151d8a94a050fa7923b99b57cd00ef74.mp4?t=1709741629\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WORLD EXPLORATION</h2>Random encounters with peaceful characters, secret rooms, riddles, dialogues will help you learn the history of this world.",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RESOURCE COLLECTION AND CRAFT</h2>On your journey, you will encounter various resources from which you can create weapons, armor, various items, or exchange them with a merchant.<br>Be careful, the space in your backpack is not endless, you will have to choose what to take with you and what to leave.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EVERY ADVENTURE WILL BE UNIQUE</h2>The Roguelike system will make each race unique, a procedurally generated map, dungeons, train stations, loot will not let you get bored!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591880/extras/3fc7e9a0de10f977b19c519737d163be.poster.avif?t=1709741629\" width=620 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591880/extras/3fc7e9a0de10f977b19c519737d163be.webm?t=1709741629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591880/extras/3fc7e9a0de10f977b19c519737d163be.mp4?t=1709741629\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BATTLE SYSTEM</h2>The weapons have unique mechanics - homing missiles, an energy ball, ballistic projectiles, and maybe ninja frogs...? Moreover, each projectile has its own type of damage - Normal, Energy, Frost, Fire, Poison. Weapons with different damage types pair well or poorly with active artifacts!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591880/extras/151d8a94a050fa7923b99b57cd00ef74.poster.avif?t=1709741629\" width=620 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591880/extras/151d8a94a050fa7923b99b57cd00ef74.webm?t=1709741629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591880/extras/151d8a94a050fa7923b99b57cd00ef74.mp4?t=1709741629\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WORLD EXPLORATION</h2>Random encounters with peaceful characters, secret rooms, riddles, dialogues will help you learn the history of this world.",
